WEBVTT

00:34.023 --> 00:38.567
The atmosphere is thinning out tonight

00:41.069 --> 00:45.973
I'm drifting past the edge of the satellite

00:49.075 --> 00:53.639
A velvet curtain falling on the glass

00:56.121 --> 01:00.845
I watch the constellations slowly pass

01:03.237 --> 01:11.399
Sermon of velvet Painted in the black We crossed

01:11.479 --> 01:19.881
the line And we can't go back Caught in the oven

01:21.762 --> 01:30.004
Losing the ground Floating away In the tide of

01:30.164 --> 01:30.904
sound

01:33.238 --> 01:52.209
Terminal Velvet

01:52.229 --> 01:56.111
The telemetry is quiet, the screen is dark

01:59.478 --> 02:04.620
Just a fading memory of the final spark.

02:07.681 --> 02:12.362
The gravity is losing its heavy hold.

02:14.543 --> 02:17.304
Out in beautiful,

02:18.164 --> 02:19.845
silent cold.

02:21.946 --> 02:30.376
Terminal valve is painted in black. We cross the

02:30.416 --> 02:38.879
line and we can't go back Caught in the orbit,

02:40.460 --> 02:49.584
losing the ground Floating away in tidal sound

02:51.925 --> 02:53.426
Terminal velvet

02:57.096 --> 03:02.863
no friction to slow us down no gravity to pull us

03:02.963 --> 03:07.328
to the ground just the endless empty space

03:07.888 --> 03:11.913
perfect frozen state of grace

03:48.126 --> 03:56.533
Terminal velvet Painted in black We crossed the

03:56.573 --> 04:03.439
line And we can't go back Caught

04:03.740 --> 04:14.289
in the orbit Losing the ground Floating away In

04:14.349 --> 04:15.530
tidal sound

04:18.110 --> 04:19.572
Terminal velvet.

04:25.561 --> 04:27.463
Slowing away.

04:29.346 --> 04:30.788
Terminal velvet.

